                                                "sense_id": "f3a946a6-bf5d-3870-82e5-1261c9cf76a3",
                                                "text": "After dialysis, the enzyme can be obtained as a dry powder by lyophilization.\nLyophilization The process of vacuum-drying substances from the frozen state. The water is sublimated into a trap at low temperature or is absorbed by drying agents. Verb: lyophilize."
